OL,3,AWatch Last Night of the Proms as
OL,4,Aclassical music showpiece to pay
OL,5,Aspecial tribute to Dolly Parton
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's the finale of the world's biggest
OL,8,Fclassical music festival at the Royal
OL,9,FAlbert Hall in London, watch the Last
OL,10,FNight of the Proms above
OL,12,FTonight there will be a special tribute
OL,13,Fto country legend Dolly Parton - who
OL,14,Fdied last month - starring Sheridan
OL,15,FSmith, Beverley Knight and Ward Thomas
OL,17,FSuperstar pianist Yuja Wang is
OL,18,Fperforming Barber's epic 26-minute
OL,19,FPiano Concerto on her return to the
OL,20,FRoyal Albert Hall - it's the first time
OL,21,Fthe technical masterpiece has been
OL,22,Fperformed at the Proms
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
